# This working directory holds many unrelated GME tools (rate fetchers,
# API secrets, Excel workbooks, logs, a SQLite DB). `gcloud run deploy
# --source .` uploads everything NOT excluded here as the build context, so
# this is a deny-all-then-allow-list: only the customer guide app's own
# code goes up. Its data (content JSON + uploaded media) is deliberately
# NOT included either - that lives in the mounted Cloud Storage bucket
# (DATA_DIR), never baked into the container image.
*
!customer_guide_server.py
!requirements.txt
!Procfile
!customer_guide_static/
!customer_guide_static/**
